      <article aria-labelledby="title">
        <h1 id="title" class="text-base leading-[1.6] font-semibold tracking-[-0.012em]">
          Nazare: Testing the Future
        </h1>

        <div class="mt-6 text-base leading-[1.6] tracking-[-0.012em]">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p>Nazare is a self-improving AI system for autonomous software evolution.</p>

            <p>
              It learns how software works, discovers patterns in how it changes, and uses that
              knowledge to make the software itself easier to modify. With each change, Nazare aims
              to improve both the software and its own ability to evolve it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-6">
            <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="mailto:f@nazare.engineering">
              f@nazare.engineering
            </a>
          </p>
